This license applies to the OnHand first-party programs, bytecode, public launcher, contracts, documentation, and original distribution materials in this distribution. All rights not expressly granted are reserved. Independent third-party licenses and genuinely existing lawful grants are unaffected.

2. Use and redistribution of complete distributions
Installation and operation of official finished products are permitted. Complete, unmodified official distributions may be freely redistributed. Redistribution must retain the original files, copyright notices, and license. Modified or repackaged versions must not be circulated as official finished products.

3. Rights not granted
This license does not grant rights to modify, adapt, or publicly publish or distribute repackaged versions. It grants no right to publicly release first-party source code and does not require OnHand to publish source code. Supplying the required launcher in readable form does not authorize public release of modified versions. No brand or trademark license is granted.

4. Existing grants and third-party materials
If particular material has genuinely been lawfully licensed under MIT or another license, those rights remain valid under that original grant; this license does not revoke or restrict them. An MIT label in an internal historical file does not by itself define an external MIT license for the entire Core in this distribution. Third-party materials are subject to their respective licenses. Rights that cannot legally be excluded are unaffected.

